@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam stateBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
title OnDelay (question 5): enabled is true only in Active

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Waiting : request && !stop
Waiting --> Idle : stop || !request
Waiting --> Active : age >= delay
Active --> Idle : !request || stop
note "Healthy stop or invalid delay: any phase -> Idle.\nUnknown request/stop: phase is kept.\nage = elapsed(phase) restarts on every phase change." as N
@enduml
